By Agency
DCLA is the contracting agency for 75.9% ($54,269,010) of arts and culture awards. DYCD and DOE are the second- and third-largest contracting agencies, with 13.9% ($9,934,127) and 6.9% ($4,900,833) of awards, respectively.


